<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Fluky on Pencroff</title><link>https://pencroff.com/categories/fluky/</link><description>Recent content in Fluky on Pencroff</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 14 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://pencroff.com/categories/fluky/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Fluky</title><link>https://pencroff.com/project/fluky/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pencroff.com/project/fluky/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Few Random Number Generator (RNG) implementations. Tested by &lt;a href="//linux.die.net/man/1/dieharder"&gt;dieharder&lt;/a&gt; tests.&#10;The tests can be executed in Docker or in Ubuntu - &lt;a href="//github.com/Pencroff/fluky/blob/main/container/README.md"&gt;ref&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/Pencroff/fluky"&gt;&lt;img src="https://pkg.go.dev/badge/github.com/Pencroff/fluky.svg" alt="Go Reference"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;a href="https://pencroff.github.io/fluky/"&gt;&lt;img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/-reference-007D9C?style=flat-square&amp;amp;logo=readthedocs&amp;amp;logoWidth=18&amp;amp;labelColor=5C5C5C&amp;amp;logoColor=FAFAFA" alt="Docs Reference"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Pencroff/fluky"&gt;Github repo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Fluky - random number generator library</title><link>https://pencroff.com/post/fluky-lib/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pencroff.com/post/fluky-lib/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I was always curious about Random Number Generator (RNG) implementation. The magic how from few numbers inside it generates long sequence &amp;ldquo;randomly&amp;rdquo; distributed numbers. I did few experiments on my ZX Spectrum with it limited performance. And this article I would like to share the &lt;a href="//github.com/Pencroff/fluky"&gt;fluky&lt;/a&gt; library.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>